Bundled font
================================================================================

Atkinson Hyperlegible Next
Copyright 2020-2024 The Atkinson Hyperlegible Next Project Authors
https://github.com/googlefonts/atkinson-hyperlegible-next

Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The OFL requires its
text to travel with the font, so the full licence ships inside the app at
`app/src/main/res/raw/atkinson_hyperlegible_ofl.txt` as well as being recorded
here.

The font is bundled rather than downloaded because the app is mostly digits
read at a glance, and this face draws them unambiguously — its slashed zero is
visible in the reset times.

